@host = http://localhost:5075

### Authenticate. Uses the same form shape as the WiGLE Android app.
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v2/activate
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

credential_0=admin&credential_1=YourStrongPassword&type=WEB

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Networks as GeoJSON, filtered by SSID (LIKE pattern)
GET {{host}}/geo/network?ssid=cafe%
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### A single network by BSSID
GET {{host}}/geo/network?bssid=ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Every recorded position of one network
GET {{host}}/geo/location?bssid=ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### A vector tile, with the same filter syntax the map uses
GET {{host}}/geo/tiles/14/8503/5454.pbf?type=W|E|B|G|L&ssid=_%&time[gt]=100d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bluetooth search (WiGLE API compatibility)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/bluetooth/search?name=gvh%&latrange1=-74.9&latrange2=77.6&longrange1=-44.9&longrange2=81.2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Upload transactions. pagestart=0 also triggers recalculation of derived columns.
GET {{host}}/api/v2/file/transactions?pagestart=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### News feed (unauthenticated; the WiGLE app polls this)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/news/latest
Accept: application/json

### Upload an observation file. Point the file reference at a local export.
POST {{host}}/api/v2/file/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WistellarUploadBoundary

--WistellarUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="WigleWifi_example.csv.gz"

< ./WigleWifi_example.csv.gz
--WistellarUploadBoundary--
